        "content": "Pilots: <a href=\"/live\" target=\"_top\">Live now</a> · <a href=\"/traffic\" target=\"_top\">Traffic</a> · <a href=\"/new-pilots\" target=\"_top\">New pilots</a> · <a href=\"/origins\" target=\"_top\">Origins</a> · <a href=\"/pilots\" target=\"_top\">Records</a> · <a href=\"/routes\" target=\"_top\">Routes</a> · <a href=\"/aircraft\" target=\"_top\">Aircraft</a> · <a href=\"/military\" target=\"_top\">Military</a> | ATC: <a href=\"/atc\" target=\"_top\">Overview</a> · <a href=\"/atc-retention\" target=\"_top\">Retention</a> · <a href=\"/atc-hours\" target=\"_top\">Hours</a> · <a href=\"/atc-positions\" target=\"_top\">Positions</a> · <a href=\"/atc-ranks\" target=\"_top\">Ranks</a> | Events: <a href=\"/live-events\" target=\"_top\">Live events</a> · **Monday events** | Management: <a href=\"/health\" target=\"_top\">Health</a>\n\nAll times are UTC. Figures cover VATPAC airspace."
